@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start --> CreateWorkspace : User initiates workspace creation
CreateWorkspace --> OrganizeTasks : Workspace created, organize tasks
CreateWorkspace --> ShareWorkspace : Share workspace with others
CreateWorkspace --> Collaborate : Begin collaboration
OrganizeTasks --> TrackProgress : Tasks organized, track progress
ShareWorkspace --> Collaborate : Workspace shared, collaborate
Collaborate --> OrganizeTasks : Continue organizing tasks
Collaborate --> TrackProgress : Track progress during collaboration
TrackProgress --> [*] : Progress tracked, exit system
OrganizeTasks --> [*] : Organizing tasks completed, exit
ShareWorkspace --> [*] : Sharing completed, exit
Collaborate --> [*] : Collaboration completed, exit
@enduml
